@ ---- Texts ----
HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorCastformBefore::
	.string "They say CASTFORM only show\nthemselves when the weather turns.\pLook around ROUTES 119, 120 and\n123 when the sky turns!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorCastformAfter::
	.string "Somebody caught a CASTFORM! So it\nreally does ride the weather near\lthe WEATHER INSTITUTE.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorCastformNotes::
	.string "Something near the WEATHER\nINSTITUTE changes with the sky…\pIt only appears when the\nweather turns.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorFeebasBefore::
	.string "A fisherman swears a little pond\non ROUTE 119 hides a POKéMON\lnobody else can find.\pOnly after sundown, and only with\nthe plainest rod, he says!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorFeebasAfter::
	.string "So FEEBAS really lives in that\npond on ROUTE 119! The first one\leven had a PRISM SCALE.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorFeebasNotes::
	.string "A shabby fish hides in a still\npond above the falls. It only\lbites after sundown, on an\lold rod.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMasquerainBefore::
	.string "In HOENN, MASQUERAIN only flutter\nout of the grass on rainy days.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMasquerainAfter::
	.string "Somebody caught a MASQUERAIN in\nthe rain! I knew those rainy days\lwere worth it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMasquerainNotes::
	.string "A bug with eye-patterned wings\nonly comes out on HOENN's\lrainy days.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorLaprasBefore::
	.string "Every Friday, a LAPRAS is said to\nsing deep down in UNION CAVE.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorLaprasAfter::
	.string "Somebody met UNION CAVE's Friday\nLAPRAS! Its song is real\lafter all.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorLaprasNotes::
	.string "Deep in a JOHTO cave, a song can\nbe heard once a week. Which day\lwas it…?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorRaltsBefore::
	.string "They say the only RALTS in HOENN\nlives on ROUTE 102, with a\lGARDEVOIR watching over it.\pIt won't let just anyone near.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorRaltsAfter::
	.string "Someone earned that GARDEVOIR's\ntrust! The RALTS on ROUTE 102 went\lwith them.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorRaltsNotes::
	.string "On a quiet HOENN route, a guardian\nreads the hearts of those who\lcome near.\pCome in the morning, and\ndon't rush.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMachampBefore::
	.string "The KARATE KING in MT. MORTAR\nspars with a wild MACHAMP every\lmorning, they say.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMachampAfter::
	.string "Somebody watched KIYO's morning\nmatch with that MACHAMP! Not a\lpeep the whole time, I heard.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMachampNotes::
	.string "Deep in a JOHTO mountain, two\nfighters meet every morning.\lWatch quietly…$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorScizorBefore::
	.string "On TUESDAY, THURSDAY and SATURDAY\nevenings, the SCYTHER behind the\lNATIONAL PARK's trees duel.\pThey say a SCIZOR breaks it up!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorScizorAfter::
	.string "Somebody saw the NATIONAL PARK's\nSCIZOR! It's so fast, nobody had\lever seen it properly.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorScizorNotes::
	.string "In a JOHTO park, blades clash at\ndusk on the bug contest's\lold days.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorGengarBefore::
	.string "They say a GENGAR hides in\npeople's shadows at night, here\lin LAVENDER.\pIt leads you on a chase, and only\nthe trainers it likes get to\lsee it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorGengarAfter::
	.string "A GENGAR came out of somebody's\nshadow and went with them!\lLAVENDER's nights feel\lquieter now.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorGengarNotes::
	.string "In a KANTO town of quiet\nmemorials, your shadow may laugh\lat night. Follow it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorSageBefore::
	.string "The SLOWKING in the SLOWPOKE WELL\nasks one riddle a day, a new one\leach weekday.\pAnswer all seven and you'll hear\nits whole prophecy.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorSageAfter::
	.string "Somebody heard the SLOWKING's\nwhole prophecy! Something about\llights under the sea.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorSageNotes::
	.string "A wise king in a JOHTO well asks\none riddle each day of the week.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMunchlaxBefore::
	.string "They say a MUNCHLAX on ROUTE 113\nhas been asleep so long, the ash\lis piling up on it.\pSomething sweet-sounding might\nwake it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMunchlaxAfter::
	.string "Somebody woke the sleepy MUNCHLAX\non ROUTE 113! There was a grotto\lbehind it the whole time.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorMunchlaxNotes::
	.string "A sleeping glutton blocks a path\nin the ash. A flute of glass might\lwake it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorSpindaBefore::
	.string "They say a SPINDA dances in the\nfalling ash on ROUTE 113, on a\lmorning once a week.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorSpindaAfter::
	.string "Somebody saw the dancing SPINDA on\nROUTE 113! Every one of them has\ldifferent spots, you know.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorSpindaNotes::
	.string "In the falling ash, on a morning\nonce a week, someone dances alone.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorSlakingBefore::
	.string "They say a SLAKING sleeps across a\npath in PETALBURG WOODS. It only\lmoves when the sun is highest.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorSlakingAfter::
	.string "Somebody caught the SLAKING in\nPETALBURG WOODS! NORMAN's old\ltraining spot is open again.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorSlakingNotes::
	.string "In the woods by PETALBURG, a lazy\ngiant only stirs at noon.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorTropiusBefore::
	.string "They say there's an orchard hidden\nin ROUTE 119's jungle, and a\lTROPIUS that tends it\levery morning.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorTropiusAfter::
	.string "Somebody found the hidden orchard\non ROUTE 119! Its tree drops rare\lfruit every day.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorTropiusNotes::
	.string "Under the FORTREE sign on ROUTE\n119, one tree is a door. Mornings,\lsomething tends fruit there.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorFeudBefore::
	.string "They say a ZANGOOSE and a SEVIPER\nfight on the lake island on ROUTE\l114, every Sunday night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorFeudAfter::
	.string "Somebody broke up the Sunday fight\non ROUTE 114's island! They'll be\lback next week, though.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorFeudNotes::
	.string "Two old enemies meet on ROUTE\n114's lake island on\lSunday nights.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorAbsolBefore::
	.string "They say a white POKéMON stands\nover ROUTE 120 on stormy nights.\lNobody's ever caught it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorAbsolAfter::
	.string "Somebody saw the white one on\nROUTE 120's ridge! Now it runs\lthrough the grass on\lstormy nights.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorAbsolNotes::
	.string "On ROUTE 120's storm nights,\nsomething white watches from the\lridge between the paths.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorWailordBefore::
	.string "They say a WAILORD sleeps in a gap\nin the rocks on ROUTE 131, and\lnothing will wake it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorWailordAfter::
	.string "The sleeping WAILORD on ROUTE 131\nwoke up! There's an atoll past the\lrocks where it was.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorWailordNotes::
	.string "A WAILORD blocks a strait on ROUTE\n131. It's waiting for its young on\lSaturday mornings.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorChimechoBefore::
	.string "They say wind chimes ring on MT.\nPYRE's summit at night, even when\lthere's no wind.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorChimechoAfter::
	.string "Somebody followed the chimes on\nMT. PYRE's summit and found a\lCHIMECHO singing!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_RumorChimechoNotes::
	.string "Chimes ring among MT. PYRE's\nsummit graves at night. Follow\lthe sound.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipDaycare::
	.string "The DAY-CARE couple on ROUTE 34\nwill raise two POKéMON for you.\pLeave two that get along, and one\nday they may find an EGG!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipBugContest::
	.string "The BUG-CATCHING CONTEST in\nJOHTO's NATIONAL PARK runs\levery day.\pCatch the best BUG POKéMON you can\nfind and you might win a prize!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipClock::
	.string "Did you know? The clock on the\nwall in any POKéMON CENTER lets\lyou set the day and the time.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipLevelCap::
	.string "With the LEVEL CAP on, your\nPOKéMON stop growing at the next\lGYM LEADER's level.\pEvery BADGE you win raises the cap\na little.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipWeather::
	.string "Some POKéMON only come out when\nthe weather turns.\pRainy days and stormy days bring\nout different faces in the grass!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipReminderJk::
	.string "A man in BLACKTHORN CITY can make\nPOKéMON remember moves\lthey've forgotten.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipNameraterJk::
	.string "The NAME RATER in GOLDENROD CITY\ncan give your POKéMON a\lbetter nickname.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipReminderH::
	.string "In FALLARBOR TOWN there's a MOVE\nREMINDER. He helps POKéMON\lremember forgotten moves.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipNameraterH::
	.string "The NAME RATER in SLATEPORT CITY\ncan change your\lPOKéMON's nicknames.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipMindReader::
	.string "A guru in MOSSDEEP CITY reads\nPOKéMON's minds.\pFor STAR PIECES, he can bring out\na POKéMON's hidden potential.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryStraitClosed::
	.string "See the rocks south of ROUTE 41?\nThere's a gap with a huge\lwhirlpool in it.\pPast it is the TIDAL STRAIT. Folks\nsay it runs all the way to HOENN,\lbut nobody gets through\lthat whirlpool.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryStraitOpen::
	.string "The whirlpool south of ROUTE 41\nhas calmed! Did you see it on TV?\pSURF through the gap in the rocks\nand follow the TIDAL STRAIT. It\lcomes out on HOENN's ROUTE 105.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryStraitDoneJ::
	.string "You SURFED the TIDAL STRAIT all\nthe way to HOENN? The sailors here\lwill be talking about that\lfor years!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryStraitH::
	.string "MR. BRINEY says the sea west of\nROUTE 105 is calm again. The TIDAL\lSTRAIT runs from there all the way\lto JOHTO!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipJkBases::
	.string "SECRET POWER works here too, not\njust in HOENN. There are hollow\ltrees in ILEX FOREST and\lVIRIDIAN FOREST.\pAnd cracked rock on ROUTE 45 and\ninside MT. MOON. Make a SECRET\lBASE in one!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineTipSites::
	.string "The old legendary sites are open\nagain: the desert ruins, SKY\lPILLAR, even the caves under\lthe sea.\pThe POKéMON that slept there are\ngone. TRAINERS are making SECRET\lBASES in them!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStorySilverCyndaquil::
	.string "Hmph. Wild CYNDAQUIL turn up in\nthe BURNED TOWER at night.\pGo catch one if you want. Mine\nwill still burn it to a crisp.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStorySilverTotodile::
	.string "Hmph. Something keeps stealing a\nfisherman's bait at the LAKE\lOF RAGE.\pIt's a wild TOTODILE. Bring a GOOD\nROD if you want it.\lMine's stronger.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStorySilverChikorita::
	.string "Hmph. There's a wild CHIKORITA in\na meadow off ROUTE 46.\pFollow the sweet smell by day.\nMine will never lose to it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryMomChikorita::
	.string "PROF. ELM dropped by today.\pHe says CHIKORITA families\nsunbathe in a meadow off ROUTE 46.\pHe thought you'd like to see them,\nsince yours started it all!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryMomCyndaquil::
	.string "PROF. ELM dropped by today.\pHe says TYPHLOSION nest in the\nBURNED TOWER at night.\pHe thought you'd like to see them,\nsince yours started it all!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryMomTotodile::
	.string "PROF. ELM dropped by today.\pHe says a FERALIGATR raises its\nTOTODILE in the LAKE OF RAGE.\pHe thought you'd like to see them,\nsince yours started it all!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideRunawayTotodile::
	.string "Our lab's TOTODILE is still\nloose somewhere.\pA fisherman at the LAKE OF RAGE\nkeeps losing his bait. That's\lour guess!\pIt knows our lab's smell. If it\nsees you, it'll come to you!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideRunawayChikorita::
	.string "Our lab's CHIKORITA is still\nloose somewhere.\pI saw it run into the tall grass\non ROUTE 46, by day.\pIt knows our lab's smell. If it\nsees you, it'll come to you!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideRunawayCyndaquil::
	.string "Our lab's CYNDAQUIL is still\nloose somewhere.\pSomeone saw it by ECRUTEAK's\nBURNED TOWER, after dark.\pIt knows our lab's smell. If it\nsees you, it'll come to you!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideChikorita::
	.string "The PROF. is writing about\nCHIKORITA on ROUTE 46.\pThere's a hidden meadow there.\nHave you seen them?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideCyndaquil::
	.string "The PROF. is writing about\nTYPHLOSION in the BURNED TOWER.\pThey bring their young there at\nnight. Have you seen them?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAideTotodile::
	.string "The PROF. is writing about a\nFERALIGATR in the LAKE OF RAGE.\pIt raises its TOTODILE in the\nsouth cove. Have you seen them?$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryBillGarden::
	.string "My grandson BILL says BULBASAUR\nmeet in a garden behind our house.\pIn the morning, slip through the\ntrees above the overlook!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryCeruleanCharmander::
	.string "The NURSE keeps looking out at\nthe rain.\pShe saw a CHARMANDER by NUGGET\nBRIDGE at dusk.\pIt was waiting in the rain. Its\nflame was so small…$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryFerry::
	.string "PROF. OAK is said to give TRAINERS\nwith all 16 BADGES a ticket for\lthe ship to HOENN.\pShips leave from VERMILION's port.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryNorman::
	.string "NORMAN of PETALBURG only battles\nTRAINERS who already have four\lHOENN BADGES.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryWattson::
	.string "WATTSON won't battle until someone\nfixes the generator in\lNEW MAUVILLE.\pHe's looking for a TRAINER\nto help!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryMeteorite::
	.string "The MOSSDEEP GYM twins won't\nbattle until the SPACE CENTER gets\lits meteorite back.\pCOZMO in FALLARBOR might know\nwhere one is.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryWinona::
	.string "FORTREE's GYM LEADER WINONA has\nbeen out by the WEATHER INSTITUTE\lon ROUTE 119.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryPond::
	.string "Every morning a SWAMPERT brings\ntwo MUDKIP to this pond\lto practice.\pWhen they all dive, you'd better\nfind some shelter!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryRalts::
	.string "Every morning, a GARDEVOIR guards\na RALTS by the tall grass\lnear PETALBURG.\pRun up to them and they vanish!\nWalk slowly, with a POKéMON that\lreally loves you.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryScizor::
	.string "Some evenings you can hear blades\nclashing behind the trees in the\lnorth-east corner.\pTUESDAYS, THURSDAYS, SATURDAYS…\nthe old contest days. Watch from\lthe little path at the top of\lthe park!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryGengar::
	.string "On some nights, folks here swear\ntheir own shadows grin at them.\pIf yours does, follow where it\npoints. It only plays at night.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStorySage::
	.string "That SLOWKING down the well asks a\nriddle every day, a different one\lfor each day of the week.\pSolve them all and it tells you a\nwhole prophecy. Grandpa KURT says\lit's about the sea.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryMunchlax::
	.string "There's a MUNCHLAX asleep in the\ntrees by the first ash fields.\lIt's been there for weeks!\pThe glassblower says he's working\non something that could wake it.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStorySpinda::
	.string "Some mornings a SPINDA dances in\nthe ash, up by the sign past\lthe twins.\pOnly once a week, mind you. It's a\nshy one.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStorySlaking::
	.string "A SLAKING sleeps in the gap in the\ntrees up north. NORMAN used to\ltrain back there.\pIt only ever gets up at noon. Then\nit's grumpy!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryTropius::
	.string "TROPIUS shakes fruit off its neck\nwhen the sun comes up.\pI saw one fly into the trees under\nthe FORTREE sign on ROUTE 119.\lRight into a tree!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryFeebas::
	.string "Nobody looks twice at the fish in\nthat little pond up the route.\pGrandpa says it only bites after\ndark, and only on an OLD ROD.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryFeud::
	.string "Every Sunday night, same island on\nROUTE 114's lake, same fight.\pZANGOOSE and SEVIPER. Surf out\nthere if you dare!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryAbsol::
	.string "The white one stands on the cliff\nwhen the storm rolls in.\pOn ROUTE 120, up on the ridge\nbetween the paths. Only on the\lstormy nights, mind you.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryWailord::
	.string "There's a WAILORD asleep in the\nrocks off ROUTE 131. Been there\lsince spring.\pIt's always listening for its\nlittle ones. Saturday mornings, it\lnearly wakes up.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_LineStoryChimecho::
	.string "On still nights, the chimes up\nhere ring by themselves.\pFollow the sound between the\ngraves, if you're brave enough.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_Forecast0::
	.string "Storms are rolling in around ROUTE\n120 {STR_VAR_1}.\pFolks say that's when the white\none walks.$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_Forecast1::
	.string "Our instruments say ROUTE 120 gets\na thunderstorm {STR_VAR_1}.\pCASTFORM come out in weather\nlike that!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_Forecast2::
	.string "Our instruments say a thunderstorm\nreaches ROUTE 119 {STR_VAR_1}.\pCASTFORM come out in weather\nlike that!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_Forecast3::
	.string "Our instruments say heavy rain\nreaches ROUTE 123 {STR_VAR_1}.\pCASTFORM come out in weather\nlike that!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_Forecast4::
	.string "Rain is coming to ROUTES 101 to\n104 {STR_VAR_1}.\pThat's when MASQUERAIN flutter out\nof the grass!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_Forecast5::
	.string "Rain is coming to the routes\naround MAUVILLE {STR_VAR_1}.\pThat's when MASQUERAIN flutter out\nof the grass!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_Forecast6::
	.string "Rain is coming to ROUTES 114 and\n115 {STR_VAR_1}.\pThat's when MASQUERAIN flutter out\nof the grass!$"

HoennSeek_Text_Hint_Forecast7::
	.string "Rain is coming to ROUTE\n121 {STR_VAR_1}.\pThat's when MASQUERAIN flutter out\nof the grass!$"

HoennSeek_Text_FieldNotesIntro:
	.string "Oh, hello! I keep PROF. BIRCH's\nfield notes on POKéMON rumors from\lall over.\pYou've confirmed {STR_VAR_1} of the\n{STR_VAR_2} rumors in my notes\lso far!$"

HoennSeek_Text_FieldNotesNext:
	.string "Here's one nobody has\nconfirmed yet…$"

HoennSeek_Text_FieldNotesAllFound:
	.string "Every rumor in my notes,\nconfirmed! You're a better field\lresearcher than I am.\pI'll write down any new ones I\nhear about.$"

HoennSeek_Text_TVForecastIntro:
	.string "It's the weather forecast!$"

